---
config:
  theme: forest
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Phone
    participant Hub
    participant Lamp
    Phone->>Hub: Turn the lamp on
    Hub-)Lamp: Switch on
    Lamp--)Hub: On
    Hub-->>Phone: Done
    Phone-xHub: Cancel the timer
    Phone<<->>Hub: Keep the link alive
    Hub-|\Lamp: Dim to half
    Hub()->>()Lamp: Set the color
    Note right of Lamp: wrap:A note that wraps because of its wrap prefix
